This license covers the code written for NGT Studio (ngt_studio.py, m1render.cpp,
jukebox_rom/, tests/, windows/ build scripts and the documentation). The bundled
ymfm (BSD 3-Clause) and z80 (MIT) libraries keep their own licenses: see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
It does NOT cover any Neo Geo game, BIOS or music: none is included, and the
ROMs you build contain data taken from your own neogeo.zip and romsets; do not
distribute them.
It does NOT cover the built-in screen-saver pictures (JB_BOXES_B85 in
ngt_studio.py and the jukebox tiles). The game box and the Neo Geo console show
SNK artwork and trademarks, (c) SNK. The Delta Island logo and triangle and the
spinning CD icon are artwork by the author (Nic034 / Delta Island), all rights
reserved. None of them is licensed under the MIT License.
It does NOT cover the three "Toasty" pictures (JB_TOASTY_B85 in ngt_studio.py,
jukebox_rom/art/toasty_frame*.png): portraits of real people, all rights
reserved by their authors (Aurelien / Bouz for the first one, whose mug shows a
Pac-Man design, Bandai Namco).  It does NOT cover the Toasty sound
(JB_TOASTY_SND_B85): the "Toasty!" shout of Mortal Kombat II, (c) Midway /
Warner Bros., embedded at the project author's decision and removable
(see NOTICE.md).
See NOTICE.md and LEGAL_NOTICE.md at the root of the repository for the
details (what is covered, trademarks, network access, privacy).
